-    $$ A(x) = \frac{1}{K} \sum_{k=1}^{K} w_k A_k(x) $$
-    where $A(x)$ is the combined local ambient occlusion, $K$ is the number of ray directions, and $w_k$ is the weight for direction $k$ [S2, unofficial].
